#. macro: <if ($n1 == 0)><else><set-time $n1><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year> <num $hour>:<num2 $min><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year> <num $h… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
